        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Complete sewer system, DN 600, profile 1 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymere concrete pipe, ID 600 mm, outer diameter 710 mm, wall thickness 55 mm, 260 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe, DN 600, profile 2A according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with polymere concrete pipe.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
